Gen 13:1 , Abram and Lot return with great riches out of Egypt;
Gen 13:6 , Strife arises between Abram's herdsmen and those of Lot;
Gen 13:8 , Abram meekly refers it to Lot to choose his part of the country
Gen 13:10 , and Lot goes to Sodom;
Gen 13:14 , God renews the promise to Abram;
Gen 13:18 , He removes to Hebron, and there builds an altar.
